      "description": "<p>The grauladon hisses and unleashes a nauseating cloud of halitosis in a 15ft Cone. Each creature in the area must succeed at a DC 18 Fortitude Saving Throw saving throw or be Sickened 1 (Sickened 2 on a critical failure).</p>\n<p>The grauladon can't use Noxious Breath or Reactive Breath again for 1d4 rounds.</p>",
